Subject: [PATCH 171/244] Update script versions for faster deployment

Update script versions in multiple HTML files to improve build times.

Replit-Commit-Author: Agent
Replit-Commit-Session-Id: d517740c-e24b-4d05-80ee-1f4fb8ac02ea
Replit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint
